📌 Project Overview-
E-commerce businesses often waste marketing dollars on blanket discount campaigns that under-reward high-value buyers and over-spend on inactive users.
This project solves that challenge by analyzing 1,000,000+ line items from the UCI Online Retail II dataset. Using rule-based quartile scoring, customers are categorized into 5 distinct lifecycle segments: 
•	Champions
•	Loyal Customers
•	Promising / New
•	At Risk
•	Lost Customers
🛠️ Tech Stack & Requirements-
•	Language: Python 3.x
•	Core Libraries: pandas, numpy, datetime, matplotlib
•	Dataset: UCI Online Retail II Dataset
•	Reporting: Pure Python console summaries + Matplotlib charts
